# from the top of the screen. It keeps an eye on Claude Code sessions (what they're doing, and
# Allow / Deny for their permission requests) and grows into Ask GUY, the search bar that used to
# be spotlight, on Alt+Space. After Coucou (github.com/Louis-CFM/coucou), rebuilt for Hyprland.
